Exploratory multi-stage E1 analyses (WS1a): out-of-sample test of Eq. (1) from development to test and R, source-epoch replication accounting with class-stratified R and Holm on the non-detection family (10,000 draws), short-world prediction from the twelve-month terms, E3 cost-model split, pooled HoldMem noise floor

